                    its information under a separate covering memorandum by Lay, Mar. 10, 1953.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d417-f2" n="2" xml:id="d417-f2-content">
                <p>For the authorization to settle the problem of ROK currency advances to U.S. forces, see memorandum of discussion
